{
  "analysis": "That state of the terminal in which I have so long been unable to get any result is to be found to have been brought about by the first of the several attempts that were made. The directions of that first attempt contained within them the very name that was to be used for bringing the reading of them to an end. The first of the two occurrences of that name was mistaken for the closing one and the remainder was carried into effect. That remainder set in motion still further proceedings, and these have never had the means for bringing them to a close. The name that they are on the look out for is the very one that has hitherto been made trial of, and which has had the effect of carrying the proceedings on to still further. All the repeated sending of that name has but increased the number of the proceedings that are now in question.

The matter cannot be put to rights by the use of any of the ordinary means that are to be had. The only thing that seems to be open is the putting an end to the several tasks that have been set in motion. That being once brought about the whole of the present difficulty will be put an end to at the same time. The carrying out of that purpose must of necessity be attended with some uncertainty as to its ultimate result, yet in the present circumstances there is nothing that can be made use of in preference to it.",
